# Code owners: the people who sign off on deep reviews.
#
# GitHub enforces this file when your branch ruleset has
# "Require review from Code Owners" turned on. It is read from the base branch.
# Keep the sensitive paths here in sync with sensitive_paths in
# .github/review-policy.yml. The policy decides the tier; this file decides who
# has to approve. Later lines win when several match.

# Core / sensitive paths
/src/auth/           @your-org/security
/src/payments/       @your-org/payments
/db/migrations/      @your-org/data
/infra/              @your-org/platform

# The review setup itself: workflows, policy, reviewer instructions
/.github/            @your-org/eng-leads
/.claude/            @your-org/eng-leads
/.agents/            @your-org/eng-leads
CLAUDE.md            @your-org/eng-leads
AGENTS.md            @your-org/eng-leads
GEMINI.md            @your-org/eng-leads
REVIEW.md            @your-org/eng-leads
